---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { legal } from "../data/legal";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Rancher handles partnership inquiries, calculator scenarios, outreach consent, and calendar bookings."
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how the {legal.operator} website handles
    information when you browse, explore a calculator scenario, submit a
    partnership inquiry, or continue to a booking service. A separate written
    agreement governs any actual data-licensing partnership.
  </p>
  <h2>Information you provide</h2>
  <p>
    The inquiry form collects your name, work email, company, team size,
    available data history, selected record types, additional context, and
    outreach consent. If you select a calculator scenario before submitting, we
    also record its employee count, years, region, and the indicative estimate
    calculated by our server.
  </p>
  <p>
    Using the calculator alone does not submit your scenario. Clicking “Submit
    &amp; book a call” sends the completed inquiry to Rancher. Do not include
    credentials, sensitive business records, or personal information about other
    people in the description.
  </p>
  <h2>How we use submissions</h2>
  <p>
    We store your inquiry to assess potential data-licensing opportunities,
    follow up about your request, and keep a record of your outreach preference.
    The record includes submission time and the consent wording shown on the
    form. The consent checkbox starts selected, and the form requires it to
    remain selected before an inquiry can be sent.
  </p>
  <p>
    Submitting an inquiry does not grant Rancher a license to your underlying
    business data or create a licensing commitment.
  </p>
  <h2>Storage and service providers</h2>
  <p>
    Vercel hosts the website and processes form requests. Submissions are stored
    in a Supabase-managed PostgreSQL database. Database credentials remain on
    the server, and the submission records are not available through a public
    browser database API. Authorized operators and service providers may access
    information as needed to operate and support the service.
  </p>
  <p>
    Submissions remain in the database until deleted. Rancher does not currently
    offer an account portal or an automatic deletion schedule through this
    website. You can request correction, deletion, or an end to outreach by
    replying to a Rancher communication you receive. Applicable law may provide
    additional rights concerning your information.
  </p>
  <h2>Calendar booking</h2>
  <p>
    After your inquiry is saved, the website redirects you to the configured
    calendar-booking service, initially{" "}
    <a href="https://cal.com/growthcast/discovery">Cal.com</a>. Your form fields
    are not added to the booking URL. Information you enter on the booking site
    is handled under that service's privacy practices. Opening the calendar does
    not itself create a booking.
  </p>
  <h2>Technical information, cookies, and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    Hosting and network providers may process IP addresses, browser information,
    requested URLs, and request times to deliver and protect the site. Their
    handling of infrastructure logs depends on their services and
    configurations. Our submission record does not include your IP address or
    user-agent string.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site's application does not set advertising cookies, install analytics
    scripts, or save your form entries in local storage. Your browser may
    separately retain autofill information according to its settings. We do not
    sell inquiry information or use it for cross-context advertising.
  </p>
  <h2>Your choices and external links</h2>
  <p>
    You may browse and use the calculator without completing the inquiry form.
    You may edit your entries before submitting or choose not to submit.
    Following a link to another website takes you to a service governed by its
    own terms and privacy practices.
  </p>
  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the website and its information practices
    change. The date above identifies the latest version. Nothing in this policy
    limits privacy rights that apply to you under law.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
